
# Action definitions for Colang 2.x resolution

# We use bare action declarations to avoid 'Unexpected token )' errors seen in fixed10.
# The wrapper flow in main_logic.co will handle argument passing.
#
# NOTE (R-22 fix, 2026-03-10): Financial safety action declarations
# (check_approval_token, check_data_latency, check_drawdown_limit,
# check_slippage_risk, check_atomic_execution) were removed from this file
# together with their corresponding Colang flows in main_logic.co.
# Financial policy enforcement is owned by the safety_check_node → OPA path.
# The corresponding Python implementations are pass-through stubs in
# config/rails/actions.py registered by nemo_action_registry.get_all_actions().
action MaskPIIAction
action InvokeVllmFallbackAction
action CustomSelfCheckInputAction
action CustomSelfCheckOutputAction
action LogSafetyAuditAction
